+\subsection{Matching model specification to the response of interest}
+The controlled benchmark supports explicit attention to the probability changes queried in scenario analysis. Within the tested neural architecture and six held-out personas, both paired objectives reduce mean response error relative to soft KL. Their difference is small, and neither improves mean interaction error. The conditional flat region of the direction+magnitude penalty further cautions against interpreting its name as a directional guarantee. The methodological lesson is to define and evaluate the required contrast, rather than infer response fidelity from endpoint fit or objective design alone.
 
